  "core_idea": "Gateways, identity services, observability and cost tools already see agents at work, but none can see what each agent is for. An Agent Behaviour Policy writes that down and turns their measurements into judgements. RiskMandate's partner programme offers three ways in: integration partners that read mandates by API and return findings as evidence, referral partners, and co-sell partners. RiskMandate gives the mandate API, templates, co-branding and case studies; partners give evidence, agents with no policy and a route to customers. Shares and prices are proposals.",
